title><![CDATA[“I don't have much time”: Candace Owens says Charlie Kirk appeared in her dreams with a disturbing warning about who betrayed him]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126494765.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Candace Owens shared a disturbing account of recurring dreams in which Charlie Kirk appeared urgently, claiming he had been betrayed. She said the message became clearer weeks later, revealing a specific name that compelled her to reach out privately. Owens emphasized the vividness of the experience and noted that her message went unanswered, deepening lingering questions.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/i-dont-have-much-time-candace-owens-says-charlie-kirk-appeared-in-her-dreams-with-a-disturbing-warning-about-who-betrayed-him/articleshow/126494765.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/i-dont-have-much-time-candace-owens-says-charlie-kirk-appeared-in-her-dreams-with-a-disturbing-warning-about-who-betrayed-him/articleshow/126494765.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-13T06:12:58+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126494765,imgsize-47526.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[“Supposed to be a secret”: Creepy 140-year-long YouTube upload is unsettling the internet for one chilling reason]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126494547.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A mysterious YouTube channel has gone viral after uploading a silent black screen video that appears to run for 140 years. The impossible runtime has sparked confusion, glitch theories, and conspiracy talk online. With millions of views and no clear explanation, the upload has left viewers unsettled and questioning how such a video could exist on the platform.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/supposed-to-be-a-secret-creepy-140-year-long-youtube-upload-is-unsettling-the-internet-for-one-chilling-reason/articleshow/126494547.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/supposed-to-be-a-secret-creepy-140-year-long-youtube-upload-is-unsettling-the-internet-for-one-chilling-reason/articleshow/126494547.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-13T05:05:59+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-126494547,imgsize-9730.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[How old is Marlon the streamer as viral Indiyah Polack video sparks fresh questions about Dami Hope cheating rumors]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/126492242.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Marlon Lundgren Garcia is 24 years old and went viral after a video showed him kissing Indiyah Polack in December 2025. The clip surfaced after Indiyah and Dami Hope reportedly split around Christmas. Both Marlon and Indiyah addressed the video, denying secrecy and accepting responsibility, while fans continue to debate the timeline.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/how-old-is-marlon-the-streamer-as-viral-indiyah-polack-video-sparks-fresh-questions-about-dami-hope-cheating-rumors/articleshow/126492242.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/how-old-is-marlon-the-streamer-as-viral-indiyah-polack-video-sparks-fresh-questions-about-dami-hope-cheating-rumors/articleshow/126492242.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-01-13T03:40:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Sehja